roduct-category\">\r\n                                Responsible Denim\r\n                            </span>\r\n\r\n                            <h3>\r\n                                Straight Fit Denim\r\n                            </h3>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"product-bottom\">\r\n\r\n                                <span class=\"price\">$110</span>\r\n\r\n                                <button class=\"add-button\">\r\n                                    Add to Cart\r\n                                </button>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                    </article>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"container\" id=\"story\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"story-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"story-image\">\r\n\r\n                    <img\r\n                        src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1445205170230-053b83016050?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\"\r\n                        alt=\"Sustainable clothing store\"\r\n                    >\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"story-content\">\r\n\r\n                    <span class=\"eyebrow\">\r\n                        Our responsibility\r\n                    </span>\r\n\r\n                    <h2>\r\n                        Better choices should feel effortless.\r\n                    </h2>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        VERDE was built on a simple belief:\r\n                        the things we wear every day should respect both\r\n                        the people who make them and the world we live in.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"impact-list\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"impact-item\">\r\n\r\n                            <span class=\"impact-number\">01</span>\r\n\r\n                            <div>\r\n                                <h4>Thoughtful materials</h4>\r\n\r\n                                <p>\r\n                                    We prioritize organic, recycled,\r\n                                    and lower-impact fibers.\r\n                                </p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"impact-item\">\r\n\r\n                            <span class=\"impact-number\">02</span>\r\n\r\n                            <div>\r\n                                <h4>Responsible production</h4>\r\n\r\n                                <p>\r\n                                    We work with partners committed\r\n                                    to ethical and transparent practices.\r\n                                </p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"impact-item\">\r\n\r\n                            <span class=\"impact-number\">03</span>\r\n\r\n                            <div>\r\n                                <h4>Designed to last</h4>\r\n\r\n                                <p>\r\n                                    Timeless silhouettes made to stay\r\n                                    in your wardrobe for years.\r\n                                </p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"reviews\" id=\"reviews\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n\r\n                    <div>\r\n\r\n                        <span class=\"eyebrow\">\r\n                            Loved by our community\r\n                        </span>\r\n\r\n                        <h2>\r\n                            Clothes with a<br>\r\n                            better story.\r\n                        </h2>\r\n\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Thoughtfully made pieces,\r\n                        chosen by people who care about\r\n                        quality as much as impact.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"review-grid\">\r\n\r\n                    <article class=\"review-card\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"stars\">\r\n                            ★★★★★\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            “The quality immediately stood out.\r\n                            The fabric feels incredible and the fit\r\n                            is exactly what I was looking for.”\r\n                        </p>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"review-user\">\r\n                            <strong>Emma Wilson</strong>\r\n                            <span>Verified customer</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                    </article>\r\n\r\n                    <article class=\"review-card\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"stars\">\r\n                            ★★★★★\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            “It feels good knowing that I can build\r\n                            a better wardrobe without compromising\r\n                            on style.”\r\n                        </p>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"review-user\">\r\n                            <strong>Daniel Brooks</strong>\r\n                            <span>Verified customer</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                    </article>\r\n\r\n                    <article class=\"review-card\">\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"stars\">\r\n                            ★★★★★\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            “Minimal, timeless and beautifully made.\r\n                            These are genuinely pieces I can see\r\n                            myself wearing for years.”\r\n                        </p>\r\n\r\n                        <div class=\"review-user\">\r\n                            <strong>Sophia Lee</strong>\r\n                            <span>Verified customer</span>\r\n                        </div>\r\n\r\n                    </article>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </section>\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"container\" id=\"newsletter\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"newsletter-box\">\r\n\r\n                <span class=\"eyebrow\">\r\n                    Stay connected\r\n                </span>\r\n\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    A better wardrobe starts here.\r\n                </h2>\r\n\r\n                <p>\r\n                    Receive new collection updates,\r\n                    thoughtful stories, and exclusive\r\n                    access to future releases.\r\n                </p>\r\n\r\n                <form class=\"newsletter-form\" id=\"newsletterForm\">\r\n\r\n                    <input\r\n                        type=\"email\"\r\n                        id=\"email\"\r\n                        placeholder=\"Enter your email address\"\r\n                        required\r\n                    >\r\n\r\n                    <button\r\n                        type=\"submit\"\r\n                        class=\"primary-button\"\r\n                    >\r\n                        Join VERDE\r\n                    </button>\r\n\r\n                </form>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </section>\r\n\r\n    </main>\r\n\r\n    <footer>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-grid\">\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"footer-brand\">\r\n\r\n                    <div class=\"logo\">\r\n                        VERDE\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        Thoughtfully designed clothing\r\n                        for a more conscious future.\r\n                    </p>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"footer-column\">\r\n\r\n                    <h4>Shop</h4>\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"#products\">New Arrivals</a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#collections\">Women</a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#collections\">Men</a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#products\">Essentials</a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"footer-column\">\r\n\r\n                    <h4>About</h4>\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"#story\">Our Story</a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#story\">Sustainability</a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#reviews\">Reviews</a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"footer-column\">\r\n\r\n                    <h4>Support</h4>\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"#home\">Contact</a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#home\">Shipping</a>\r\n                    <a href=\"#home\">Returns</a>\r\n\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\r\n\r\n                <span>\r\n                    © <span id=\"year\"></span> VERDE.\r\n                    All rights reserved.\r\n                </span>\r\n\r\n                <span>\r\n                    Made with a lighter footprint.\r\n                </span>\r\n\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n    </footer>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\">\r\n        Product added to your cart.\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <script>\r\n\r\n        const menuButton =\r\n            document.getElementById(\"menuButton\");\r\n\r\n        const navLinks =\r\n            document.getElementById(\"navLinks\");\r\n\r\n        const header =\r\n            document.getElementById(\"header\");\r\n\r\n        const cartCount =\r\n            document.getElementById(\"cartCount\");\r\n\r\n        const toast =\r\n            document.getElementById(\"toast\");\r\n\r\n        let cartItems = 0;\r\n\r\n        menuButton.addEventListener(\r\n            \"click\",\r\n            () => {\r\n                navLinks.classList.toggle(\"active\");\r\n            }\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll(\".nav-links a\")\r\n            .forEach((link) => {\r\n\r\n                link.addEventListener(\r\n                    \"click\",\r\n                    () => {\r\n                        navLinks.classList.remove(\"active\");\r\n                    }\r\n                );\r\n\r\n            });\r\n\r\n        window.addEventListener(\r\n            \"scroll\",\r\n            () => {\r\n\r\n                if (window.scrollY > 20) {\r\n                    header.classList.add(\"scrolled\");\r\n                } else {\r\n                    header.classList.remove(\"scrolled\");\r\n                }\r\n\r\n            }\r\n        );\r\n\r\n        document.querySelectorAll(\".add-button\")\r\n            .forEach((button) => {\r\n\r\n                button.addEventListener(\r\n                    \"click\",\r\n                    () => {\r\n\r\n                        cartItems++;\r\n\r\n                        cartCount.textContent =\r\n                            cartItems;\r\n\r\n                        toast.classList.add(\"show\");\r\n\r\n                        setTimeout(\r\n                            () => {\r\n                                toast.classList.remove(\"show\");\r\n                            },\r\n                            2500\r\n                        );\r\n\r\n                    }\r\n                );\r\n\r\n            });\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById(\"cartButton\")\r\n            .addEventListener(\r\n                \"click\",\r\n                () => {\r\n\r\n                    alert(\r\n                        `You currently have ${cartItems} item(s) in your cart.`\r\n                    );\r\n\r\n                }\r\n            );\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById(\"newsletterForm\")\r\n            .addEventListener(\r\n                \"submit\",\r\n                (event) => {\r\n\r\n                    event.preventDefault();\r\n\r\n                    const email =\r\n                        document.getElementById(\"email\");\r\n\r\n                    alert(\r\n                        `Thank you for joining VERDE, ${email.value}!`\r\n                    );\r\n\r\n                    email.value = \"\";\r\n\r\n                }\r\n            );\r\n\r\n        document.getElementById(\"year\").textContent =\r\n            new Date().getFullYear();\r\n\r\n    </script>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>"
